  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Etana Energy (Pty) Ltd</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enabled by government&#x2019;s steer towards power sector deregulation, Etana Energy is a newly formed South African energy trading company that will deliver clean, affordable energy for commercial users from its portfolio of wind and solar independent power producers (IPPs). Etana&#x2019;s strategy of leveraging the energy wheeling model to aggregate privately generated power for commercial sale will facilitate the uptake of green energy and help to accelerate South Africa&#x2019;s decarbonization. It will also bolster private sector investment in the sector and create a pathway to a competitive open market.</narrative>
  </description>
